8.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ha\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ha/ayah/7-148.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"es\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/es/ayah/7-148.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"de\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/de/ayah/7-148.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"zh\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/zh/ayah/7-148.html\">\n<meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"Tafsir of Al-A&#x27;raaf 7:148 — by Ibn Taymiyyah and Ibn al-Qayyim\">\n<meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"And the people of Moses made, after [his departure], from their ornaments a calf - an image having a lowing sound. Did they not see that it could neither s\">\n<meta name=\"theme-color\" content=\"#1f4d3a\">\n<link rel=\"icon\" href=\"/icon.svg\" type=\"image/svg+xml\">\n<link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com\">\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Amiri+Quran&family=Amiri:wght@400;700&family=Noto+Naskh+Arabic:wght@400;600&display=swap\">\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/theme.css\">\n<style>body{font-family:system-ui,\"Segoe UI\",sans-serif;color:var(--ink);padding:20px 16px 48px;line-height:1.6}.tr{font-size:17px;line-height:1.8;margin:0}.cr{font-size:12px;color:var(--muted)}.ar{direction:rtl;text-align:right}</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<main class=\"sp\"><nav class=\"crumbs\"><a href=\"/en/\">Home</a> › <a href=\"/en/surah/7.html\">Surah Al-A&#x27;raaf</a> › Verse 148</nav><h1>Tafsir of Surah Al-A&#x27;raaf 7:148</h1><p class=\"vt ar\" lang=\"ar\">﴿وَاتَّخَذَ قَوْمُ مُوسَىٰ مِن بَعْدِهِ مِنْ حُلِيِّهِمْ عِجْلًا جَسَدًا لَّهُ خُوَارٌ أَلَمْ يَرَوْا أَنَّهُ لَا يُكَلِّمُهُمْ وَلَا يَهْدِيهِمْ سَبِيلًا اتَّخَذُوهُ وَكَانُوا ظَالِمِينَ﴾</p><section><h3>Translation of the meaning</h3><p class=\"tr\">And the people of Moses made, after [his departure], from their ornaments a calf - an image having a lowing sound. Did they not see that it could neither speak to them nor guide them to a way? They took it [for worship], and they were wrongdoers.</p><span class=\"cr\" dir=\"ltr\">English Translation - Noor International Center — v1.1.2 · QuranEnc.com</span></section><p class=\"cr\">The words of the two imams are given in their original Arabic, verbatim, with references.</p><section><h2>Shaykh al-Islam Ibn Taymiyyah</h2><blockquote class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\">فدل ذلك على أن عدم التكلم والهداية نقص، وأن الذي يتكلم ويهدي أكمل ممن لا يتكلم<cite>«الرسالة الأكملية في ما يجب لله من صفات الكمال» 1/18</cite></blockquote><blockquote class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\">والمقصود: أن ما أخرجه كان جسدا مصمتا لا روح فيه حتى تبين نقصه وأنه كان مسلوب الحياة والحركة.<cite>«مجموع الفتاوى» 5/219</cite></blockquote></section><section><h2>Imam Ibn al-Qayyim</h2><blockquote class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\">فلو كان إله الخلق سبحانه كذلك لم يكن في هذا إنكار عليهم، واستدلال على بطلان الإلهية بذلك.<cite>«مدارج السالكين بين منازل إياك نعبد وإياك نستعين» 1/49</cite></blockquote></section><a class=\"btn pri open\" href=\"/tafsir.html?lang=en#s7a148\">Open in the interactive tafsir (full texts)</a><div class=\"pn\"><a href=\"/en/ayah/7-145.html\">Previous verse (7:145)</a><a href=\"/en/ayah/7-154.html\">Next verse (7:154)</a></div></main><footer class=\"site-foot\"><span>Tafsir al-Shaykhayn · <a href=\"/en/\">Home</a> · <a href=\"/about.html\">About the project</a> · <a href=\"/privacy.html\">Privacy &amp; terms</a></span><a href=\"https://doersadv.com\" rel=\"noopener\" dir=\"ltr\">Developed by Doers</a></footer>\n</body>\n</html>\n"}